    &lt;h1&gt;Zigbee2MQTT  🌉 🐝&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Allows you to use your Zigbee devices &lt;b&gt;without&lt;/b&gt; the vendor&#39;s bridge or gateway.
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        It bridges events and allows you to control your Zigbee devices via MQTT. In this way you can integrate your Zigbee devices with whatever smart home infrastructure you are using.
    &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.zigbee2mqtt.io/guide/getting-started&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Getting started&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.zigbee2mqtt.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt; provides you all the information needed to get up and running! Make sure you don&amp;rsquo;t skip sections if this is your first visit, as there might be important details in there for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you aren&amp;rsquo;t familiar with &lt;strong&gt;Zigbee&lt;/strong&gt; terminology make sure you &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.zigbee2mqtt.io/advanced/zigbee/01_zigbee_network.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;read this&lt;/a&gt; to help you out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;integrations&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.zigbee2mqtt.io/guide/usage/integrations.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Integrations&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zigbee2MQTT integrates well with (almost) every home automation solution because it uses MQTT. However the following integrations are worth mentioning:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img align=&#34;left&#34; height=&#34;100px&#34; width=&#34;100px&#34; src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7738048/40914297-49e6e560-6800-11e8-8904-36cce896e5a8.png&#34;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;home-assistant&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.home-assistant.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Home Assistant&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.home-assistant.io/installation/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Home Assistant OS&lt;/a&gt;: Using &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/zigbee2mqtt/hassio-zigbee2mqtt&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the official addon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other installation: using instructions &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.zigbee2mqtt.io/guide/usage/integrations/home_assistant.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img align=&#34;left&#34; height=&#34;100px&#34; width=&#34;100px&#34; src=&#34;https://etc.athom.com/logo/white/256.png&#34;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;homey&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://homey.app/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Homey&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration implemented in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://homey.app/nl-nl/app/com.gruijter.zigbee2mqtt/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Homey App&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and support in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://community.homey.app/t/83214&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Homey Forum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
